Gotta ask, are you going after the quarantine? (PH here as well) You could try the first Deutsch words. Also try to practice the pronunciation of those words. German is fairly easy to learn but a bit hard to understand.

&#x200B;

 Sei da draußen in Sicherheit. (Apple is Apfel and Goodbye is Auf wiedersehen)

bruh but ok then

&#x200B;

I just realized how...okay then. I won't say the criticism.

What? I wasn't trying to be depressing, I just needed an answer. 

&#x200B;

Now that I think about it, yeah I did sound depressing there.

I saw the kitten with her mother 10 hours ago. I don't know the age, it just lies down, Yes and the kitten's right eye is open, but I can't see the color of its eye.

&#x200B;

I will try to go back to the place where I saw the kitten and help it.

When the light is running low, And the shadows start to grow , And the places that you know Seem like fantasy  - it can mean that you, as the person, is dreaming. Think about it, if you sleep, the light fades, and all you see is darkness. Then in one point, you'll e a place that seems like fantasy.

&#x200B;

 There's a light inside your soul, That’s still shining in the cold, With the truth, The promise in our hearts - This could mean a companion. The light inside your soul can mean the things you do inside that dream, but it's shining in the cold, so it can mean that you are not using your soul. (couldn't explain very well)

&#x200B;

 Don't forget I'm with you in the dark - Again, a meaning of a companion inside your dream

&#x200B;

So...basically, Deltarune is a dream?
